    "en": {
      "trackName": "Truth or Dare: Watch Party",
      "description": "Truth or Dare for every age, on your Apple Watch and iPhone. 913 truths and dares for family game night, road trips, sleepovers and parties, plus Deck Studio to build tonight's themed deck. No accounts, no ads.\n\nNEW IN 3.0\n- An iPhone app with a hand-drawn sketchbook look and living, animated orbs\n- Deck Studio: write your own themed party decks, or let the on-device model draft eight truths and eight dares for you to review and edit. Drafting runs privately on supported devices with Apple Intelligence turned on, and works offline. Writing decks by hand works everywhere.\n- Your decks sync to the watch app automatically\n- Ask by voice: \"Give me a dare in Truth or Dare\" works on your phone and your wrist. On iPhone the answer card has Done, Another and Switch buttons right inside it\n- Widgets: today's truth and dare on the Home Screen, Lock Screen, Smart Stack and watch face, plus Quick Dare and Quick Truth controls\n- On the watch: double-tap to mark a dare done (on supported models), haptic countdowns for timed dares\n\nEVERY PROMPT REWRITTEN FOR ALL AGES\n- 15 categories: Popular, Easy, Party, Silly, Family, Work, Travel, Food, Sports, Creative, Date Night, Modern, Tech, Challenge, and Movies & TV\n- Dares happen right in the room: acting, drawing, singing, impressions and word games. No calling, posting or pranks\n- The Everything mix shuffles all categories, with Mild, Medium and Bold intensity\n\nPLAY YOUR WAY\n- Players and turns: add everyone's name and the game passes the turn around the circle\n- No Repeats: see every prompt once before any come back\n- Timed dares with a countdown ring\n- Favorites, party stats and a weekly chart\n- An optional evening reminder with the day's dare\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nNo accounts, no ads and no tracking. Everything stays on your devices.\n\nThe watch app runs on its own, so you can leave your phone in your pocket.",
      "releaseNotes": "Now free to download. A one-time Pro unlock adds deck drafting with Apple Intelligence and unlimited custom decks. Every category pack, season deck and up to three saved decks stay free. If you bought the app before, Pro is already yours.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/truth-or-dare-watch-party/id1527873405?uo=4",
