      "version": "2.5",
      "releaseNotes": "Major Update - Version 2.0\nIMPROVEMENTS\n- Completely redesigned architecture for faster performance\n- 1000+ questions across 15 categories\n- Smoother navigation and haptic feedback throughout",
      "seenAt": "2026-04-09T13:44:01Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "3.0",
      "releaseNotes": "Truth or Dare 3.0: rebuilt for every age.\n- Now on iPhone too, with a hand-drawn sketchbook design and living animated orbs\n- New Deck Studio: build themed party decks by hand, or draft them on-device and review every prompt\n- 913 brand-new truths and dares, written for families, friends and coworkers\n- Ask for a truth or a dare by voice, with interactive answer cards on iPhone\n- Widgets, Smart Stack and Control Center: today's pair, Quick Dare and Quick Truth\n- Watch: double-tap to mark a dare done, haptic countdowns, and your decks from iPhone",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-07T05:43:24Z"
    },
    {
