    },
    {
      "version": "3.1",
      "releaseNotes": "New for the holidays: season decks on the Play tab. Spooky night (Oct 24 to Nov 2), Family table (Nov 20 to 30), Countdown (Dec 26 to Jan 10), Two of us and Halftime (Feb 7 to 15).\nA Party Live Activity shows whose turn it is, Truth or Dare and the round on the Lock Screen and in the Dynamic Island.\nSeason decks play on iPhone. The Apple Watch app is unchanged.",
      "seenAt": "2026-10-14T21:59:16Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "3.2",
      "releaseNotes": "Now free to download. A one-time Pro unlock adds deck drafting with Apple Intelligence and unlimited custom decks. Every category pack, season deck and up to three saved decks stay free. If you bought the app before, Pro is already yours.",
